<h1>Feather Wallet for Linux, Windows, macOS and Tails</h1>
<p>&nbsp;Feather is a free and open-source Monero wallet designed for Linux, Tails, Windows, and macOS. It is a fast, lightweight, and privacy-focused desktop wallet that provides users with a simple and convenient way to manage their Monero.</p>
