<p>&nbsp;Feather is a free Monero desktop wallet with publicly available source code that can be reviewed and audited on GitHub. It is designed to combine ease of use with advanced features, making it suitable for both beginners and experienced Monero users.</p>
<p>&nbsp;The wallet offers fast and lightweight performance, allowing users to synchronize quickly without downloading the entire Monero blockchain. Its clean and user-friendly interface makes everyday wallet operations simple while providing access to advanced features when needed.</p>
<p>&nbsp;Privacy is a core feature of Feather. It includes built-in Tor and I2P support and offers native compatibility with the Tails operating system, helping users maintain greater privacy while using Monero. Feather is also non-custodial, meaning users retain control of their private keys. It does not require account registration or collect user data.</p>
